# LeakSanitizer suppressions for the -asan run. Each entry is the kit's own, in the BUI tree,
# which stays unmodified. It matches a function name, so the test binaries need their symbols,
# which go test strips: run with -ldflags='-s=false -w=false'.
#
# BK_context_free does not release the context's undo history: PLAN.md, Phase 4 notes.
leak:bk_strdup
